speechtext:
Section 1 was amended in committee, and an amendment was inserted, known as 1 (a), as follows:
Section i oi the said act is amended by adding thereto the following subsection:-
(g)	to prescribe the size or sizes of containers in which oysters may be shipped or taken from any province in Canada, and how such containers shall be marked;
(h)	to provide for the grading and inspection of oysters;
(i)	to prescribe how incorrectly marked containers of oysters shall be remarked and dealt with.
